l find something  better to talk about than then  reinforcement  it's worth noting that like so many  other things in the world of comics and  manga nen has an  evil opposite this dark side if you will  hey  that's catchy it's called on and was  featured prominently in the 2014 movie  hunter hunter the last mission  and snarky star wars dark side comments  aside quite frankly it's not worth  mentioning at all because the hunt hunt  films are not canon and on never makes  an appearance in the actual series which  i only bring up because once again this  article is called the untold truth of  hunter hunter  and this is the latest piece of  misinformation in a block of writing  allegedly dedicated to conveying the  truth now with all of that said the  article  isn't all bad when the writer is talking  about the background of the series like  the hiatus struggle and togashi's  relationship with naokotakuchi that's  all really good and fun stuff to read  and it's also very appropriate given the  title of the article however when  explaining hunter hunter itself this  is an utter dereliction of duty and  quite frankly a profoundly embarrassing  mess and i obviously don't want to dox  this guy but he is an  actual writer like he puts words to page  as a profession he gets paid to do this  mainly for western comics and i believe  that he is something of a batman expert  in particular all of which is very cool  by the way that sounds like quite an  amazing profession however i really do  think you should probably stick to that  area  because i imagine that if i made a video  titled the untold truth of batman  without ever having performed a passing  glance of research and just making  snarky comments then he would probably  rip me apart  and quite rightfully as well mind you  because i know hardly anything about  batman  certainly not enough to offer an article  presenting the untold truth behind the  series  i do however know about hunter hunter  though more than enough to 